# IANA Private Enterprise Numbers for the vendors reachable from an RTE.
#
# ipmitool reads this file to turn an IPMI manufacturer ID into a vendor name.
# Without it, every ipmitool invocation prints two warnings, and manufacturers
# report as unknown.
#
# Each entry is a pair of lines: the decimal enterprise number, then two spaces
# and the organization name. The parser scans for a line beginning with a number
# and reads the line straight after it as the name. Other lines are skipped, so
# comments are safe between entries but must never split an entry's two lines.
#
# To add a vendor, run "ipmitool mc info" against its BMC and copy the pair of
# lines matching the reported Manufacturer ID out of the full registry at
# https://www.iana.org/assignments/enterprise-numbers.txt
